            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Koji 鮨 幸二",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n1\nA decent meal !\nJan 2023 • Friends\nInteresting set menu (not omakase) experience located in the Japanese “hem” area. Located next to the former Oskar Bar, Sushi Koji offers decent upscale Japanese dining.\n\nStaff greet you ground level and take you up to the restaurant which is well attended.\n\nHappy to have grabbed a decent meal in Saigon that doesn’t break the bank.\n\nCertainly worthy of grabbing a meal when a flight to Japan (or Bangkok) is just out of the question.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 9, 2023",
